All images were made for this project; none are copied, traced or derived from
other pose collections. The figures are mannequins or AI-generated adults and do
not depict real people. The gallery has no runtime dependencies; its web fonts
(Inter Tight, Noto Sans SC, JetBrains Mono, SIL OFL 1.1) are loaded from Google
Fonts and are not part of this repository.
